{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49054","headline":"中秋月 · 可朋","name":"中秋月","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"登楼仍喜此宵晴，圆魄才观思便清。\n海面乍浮犹隐映，天心高挂最分明。\n片云想有神仙出，回野应无鬼魅形。\n曾向洞庭湖上看，君山半雾水初平。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"可朋","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49054.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49054","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}